  "name": "Contract Advisor",
  "description": "Provides insights into contract terms throughout the contract lifecycle by answering queries on contracts and related documents. It guides users during contract drafting by aligning third-party clauses with the organization’s standard language directly within the Word add-in. Recommends relevant, previously negotiated clauses from the contract repository to ensure consistency, reduce risk, and speed up contract authoring and negotiation.",
